					"type": "text",
					"text": "The derivative of $f$ at $x$ is the limit\n\n$$\nf'(x) = \\lim_{h \\to 0} \\frac{f(x + h) - f(x)}{h}\n$$\n\nFor $f(x) = x^2$ it is $2x$."
